  "source_findings": [
    "Nine shared helper/header implementations match the old local copy after include relocation and formatting.",
    "Gemma4 graph preserves the old architecture, layer loop, KV sharing, all MobileFC routes and optional intermediate outputs; separate-head selection avoids creating an unused tied-table handle.",
